Yippee-ki-yay movie lovers, it's Jan here
and in this video, I'm breaking down all the

00:00:14.390 --> 00:00:20.060
details in the twist ending to Fantastic Beasts
2 and explaining why you can't trust Grindelwald!

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:23.970
Keep watching to the end to find out what
crucial timeline details have been retconned

00:00:23.970 --> 00:00:25.090
in the sequel.

